      "step4_style_dist": "sqrt( Σ w[j]*(user[j]-racquet[j])² / Σ w[j] ) over 4 axes",
      "step5_sw_penalty": "★不對稱：d = racquet.sw - sw_target；d>0 → |d|*k；d<0 → |d|*k*0.5（傷病者 *0.2，因輕拍對傷者是優點）",
